ilities crisis remastered is already  out on twitch but you can grab it on ps4  xbox one and pc on friday the 18th  september actually wraps up with one  more big remake  mafia definitive edition the original  2002 game has been completely rebuilt  from the ground up  with new story content and improved  gameplay you can watch crimes get  committed in 4k  if you've got the hardware for it too  you can return to the era of gangsters  and prohibition on ps4  xbox one and pc on friday the 25th  and those are some of the hottest games  launching all month long  as always remember that release dates  are based on retailer listings and are  subject to change  thanks for watching everyone and i'll be  back with a closer look at more  september games next sunday  you

